<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Olympia 6-mth net down 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Olympia 6-mth net down 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	 5.0	vs	 7.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		  20.43     vs	25.59</p>
<p>    Turnover		   291.86     vs     276.87</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    42.07     vs	40.54</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  7.70     vs less  2.92</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Olympia Industries Bhd. It is mainly involved in gaming and property businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
